# Laravel + local nginx Build & Deployment Rules

Dev serves from this tree via nginx (`wallets-dev.nvnhan0810.com` → `public/`) and `php8.5-fpm`. **Not K3s.**

Whenever changing frontend assets (CSS, JS/TS) or Blade templates:

1. **Build:** `npm run build` in `/home/nvnhan0810/www/wallets.nvnhan0810.com`
2. **PHP-FPM:** `sudo systemctl reload php8.5-fpm` if OPcache/views look stale
3. **Verify** with `curl` against `https://wallets-dev.nvnhan0810.com` before asking the user to test

Coding standards: see `.cursor/rules/backend-standards.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/frontend-standards.mdc`.
